# DreamFusion之后SDS算法的核心改进工作
================================================================================

Magic3D: High-Resolution Text-to-3D Content Creation | 2022-11 | Two-stage coarse-to-fine optimization: low-res NeRF then high-res DMTet mesh refinement. Achieves 8x higher resolution and 2x faster than DreamFusion. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10440

ProlificDreamer: High-Fidelity and Diverse Text-to-3D Generation with Variational Score Distillation | 2023-05 | Proposes Variational Score Distillation (VSD) treating 3D parameters as random variables instead of constants. Solves SDS's over-saturation, over-smoothing, and low-diversity problems. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.16213

Score Jacobian Chaining: Lifting Pretrained 2D Diffusion Models for 3D Generation | 2022-12 | Applies chain rule on learned score gradients, back-propagating through renderer Jacobian. Addresses distribution mismatch between 2D training and 3D application. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.00774

Stable Score Distillation for High-Quality 3D Generation | 2023-12 | Identifies variance-reducing term in SDS as sub-optimal. Strategically orchestrates each term to prevent over-smoothness and color-saturation, provides theoretical understanding. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.09305

Score Distillation via Reparametrized DDIM | 2024-05 | Reformulates SDS as high-variance DDIM. Inverts DDIM in each update to recover better noise approximation, reducing over-smoothing without training extra networks. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15891

Invariant Score Distillation For Hyper-Realistic Text-to-3D Generation | 2024-07 | Decouples SDS into reconstruction and CFG terms. Uses invariant score from DDIM to replace reconstruction term, enabling medium CFG scale to avoid over-saturation/smoothing. | https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.09822



